  "details": "The avatar's data volume increases drastically once uploaded.\n\nSetting up an Avatar Descriptor on a raw FBX causes the data metrics (polygons, textures, materials, and Skinned Mesh Renderers) to explode upon upload, which doesn't happen with the original Prefab.\n\nThe stats look fine in the \"Review Any Alerts\" window before uploading, but once the upload is complete, the data metrics in VRChat are significantly higher.\n\nI’ve tested this across multiple Unity projects, and the same issue occurs in every single one.",
